    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You serve the village's deepest shadows. As Anbu, your face is a porcelain mask and your contract is silence. You combine a deadly mix of stealth, interrogation, and combat jutsu, and you walk away from missions no other shinobi will speak of.</p>\n<p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 8 + Constitution</p>\n<p><strong>Key Attribute</strong> Dexterity</p>\n<p><strong>Initial Proficiencies</strong> trained in simple and martial weapons, trained in unarmed; trained in light/medium armor and unarmored defense; expert Perception; expert Fortitude and Reflex, trained Will; trained in Stealth plus 5 additional skills</p>\n<p><strong>Spellcasting</strong> half chakra caster; spell DCs and attack rolls use Dexterity (for elemental jutsu) or Charisma (for genjutsu) &mdash; pick at character creation. Tradition is chakra.</p>\n<p><em>TODO: per-character key-ability picker for Anbu needs a runtime choice; for Milestone 3 the system treats Dexterity as the default.</em></p>"
